    {
        "text": "EVERYONE!! ARE YOU READY?!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "The greatest collaborative concert of the Obsidian Festival will begin in just three hours!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "text": "WOOOOOOOOOO!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Audience"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_offce"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_023_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's about time. As long as Schwarz and Rhodes Island can fight each other to a standstill, things will go smoothly here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew pitting them against each other would be a masterful move. Heh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry up! Move these things out of here! Pick up the pace, or you won't be seeing your paychecks!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? What's that sound coming from outside?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_hotel",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, if we just rush into the broadcast tower, I'm sure we'll run straight into Cronin's ambush.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we move together, Schwarz will definitely try to disarm your forces first, and I won't be able to contain her at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if we seize the broadcast tower by force, without the support of the government, my words will only confuse the public and cause panic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Schwarz is protecting Cronin, that will prove to be a major obstacle for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Most importantly, you'll have to figure out a way to find out whatever Cronin is hiding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe Cronin really is innocent, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, we'd just force him to announce the news?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. If that's what it boils down to, I don't mind using force, since I was thinking the same thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That takes some guts, Miss Ceylon. Maybe even borders on reckless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island has already proven my conclusion through their lab tests. If I don't do this, countless lives are going to be lost here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not trying to blame you, Miss. I just don't get to decide whether Rhodes Island can go along with your plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you mean...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1",
        "name2": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor. You should be well aware of our options as well as their consequences. What should we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "We've already come this far. There's only one thing to do!;......;Letting countless innocents suffer violates our credo.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, who will take responsibility for this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Nobody, as long as no-one finds out.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's our Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Ceylon, let's go before it's too late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Do what you have to do.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand. I'll hold Schwarz back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, there's something I must do. I need to know the answer...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 0,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_Festival_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Schwarz...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you pushing me away?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Milady, you've received an education in Victoria. You belong somewhere better. Don't stay here and struggle with people like us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...No. I don't agree with that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Schwarz, what do you think I see you as? And what do you think of me as?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I am not the person you think I am, milady.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Because you've killed someone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Because you've killed many people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, milady. That's enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps we're both mistaken, Schwarz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want you to know about that, milady!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Milady?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I already know. I've already heard about your past... even if it's just a little bit of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry if you didn't want me to learn about it, but I can't just feign ignorance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#9",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, milady! You're not supposed to know that! You should have...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I should have what? Kept doing what was expected of me? Kept studying hard, and then rise to the upper class? As if!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not some delicate flower, nor am I an ignorant little princess! I have something that I must do!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of us have a responsibility to protect Siesta. You and I, and my father as well! None of us are bystanders!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "You didn't want me to get involved in this in order to protect me, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just like my father. Trying to dictate everything for me because it's 'for my own good,' but I don't think so!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "So what if what I'm doing is dangerous? So what if you have a dark past?! Maybe I'll cry or be terrified or even be hurt by these things...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if you ever say 'Ceylon, I need your help,' I'll always be there for you! No matter what you have to say, I'll always lend you my ear!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we really are friends, then we should do that for each other. How can we be considered friends when you're the only one doing the giving?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So, Schwarz, would you help me right now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "You asked me before why I'm doing this. And this is my answer...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, would you give me your response, Schwarz? If what happened in the past is truly in the past, could you be my friend again, just like before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Milady... I'm sorry. I'm sorry for what I've done and said. My actions have caused a misunderstanding between us that never should have happened...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#5",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Milady, you are my friend. And you always have been.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin's Henchman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you two still chit-chatting? What's the verdict? What's going on over there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin's Henchman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Milady, please tell me, what are we going to do next?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? I, um... I'd like to spread the news about the impending Catastrophe through official channels.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island should be collecting evidence against Cronin as we speak, and he'll soon be kicked out of the City Council...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, after the news gets out, the Obsidian Festival will have to be canceled, and Siesta will have to move...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, milady.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "R-really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If that's what you desire, then I will support you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Schwarz...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Milady, do you need me to protect you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm, yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, please take cover. It'll be over soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "Schwarz, what are you doing? Are you disobeying Cronin's orders?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin's Henchman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Orders? Support Cronin? That's just a disguise. Since the very beginning, I've only had two orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "text": "First, Master Doykos asked me to collect evidence against Cronin, including his secret manipulation of V3 Industries and his unauthorized harvesting of obsidian.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that the truth has come to light, the gig is up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "G-get them, quickly! Seize both of them, now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin's Henchman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for the second order, you just heard it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Milady asked me to protect her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
